cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "phi-hex"
abstract: >-
  Phi-Hex studies the two-dimensional XY model and the
  Berezinskii-Kosterlitz-Thouless (BKT) transition on periodic triangular,
  honeycomb and kagome lattices, with the square lattice as a validation
  case. It combines the helicity modulus and the Nelson-Kosterlitz jump,
  Wolff cluster updates, Wang-Landau densities of states and finite-size
  scaling, with deterministic integrity gates and SHA-256 provenance.
  Research code; results are internal findings, not published reference
  values.
authors:
